{"nodes": [{"id": "claude", "label": "CLAUDE.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_measure_improve_loop", "label": "Measure / break / improve / re-measure loop", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Purpose", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Step 5 (re-run identical load profile, compare before/after SLO numbers) is the deliverable; a project without recorded before/after metrics is not finished."}, {"id": "claude_ecs_document_db", "label": "ecs-document-db (planned project)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Purpose", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_lambda_concurrency_limit", "label": "lambda-concurrency-limit (planned project)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Purpose", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_project_naming", "label": "<platform>-<scenario> project naming", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Layout / Naming", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Several scenarios per platform would leave bare ecs/ or lambda/ nowhere to go; the name is also the Project tag and commit scope, so renaming orphans tagged resources from the sweep."}, {"id": "claude_project_layout", "label": "Per-project directory layout (infra/main, grafana, k6, service, heartbeat, scripts, slo.yaml, results.md)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Working directory infra/main makes ../grafana, ../k6 and ../../heartbeat resolve inside a remote HCP run."}, {"id": "claude_per_project_deploy", "label": "Per-project deploy-service.sh", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "What 'deploy' means is a property of the platform; a shared script would need a flag per platform, which is the coupling the layout forbids."}, {"id": "claude_no_apply_in_scripts", "label": "No project script may run terraform apply", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "permissions.ask matches on command text, so an apply buried in a script never reaches the approval gate."}, {"id": "claude_platform_stack", "label": "platform/ shared Terraform root", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owns TFC project, workspaces, shared variable set and Grafana folder high-load-test; found by fixed string, never by reading its state, so project isolation still holds."}, {"id": "claude_project_isolation", "label": "Projects never share Terraform modules or state", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each project must be creatable and destroyable in isolation; duplication is preferred over coupling."}, {"id": "claude_hard_constraints", "label": "Hard constraints (Terraform-only, cheap destroy, tagging, TFC state, global secrets, SLOs as code)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Hard constraints", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_project_tag", "label": "Project = <project-dir> tag via default_tags", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Hard constraints", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The teardown sweep finds orphans with one resourcegroupstaggingapi query; an untagged resource is invisible and bills forever."}, {"id": "claude_superpowers_pipeline", "label": "Superpowers spec-driven pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Spec-driven development", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_sp_shorthand", "label": "SP = superpowers shorthand", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Spec-driven development", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_spec_amendment_rule", "label": "Later spec amends earlier: both must say so", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Spec-driven development", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without a forward-pointer at the decision itself, a reader acts on guidance reversed months ago."}, {"id": "claude_status_line_rule", "label": "Every spec/plan carries a Status: line", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Spec-driven development", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A plan left at 'in progress' that nobody is working is a lie the next reader acts on."}, {"id": "claude_k6_threshold_tdd", "label": "k6 threshold as the red-green analogue for infra", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Adapting the skills to infrastructure", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HCL is configuration, so unit tests are not 